WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
No sound, or crackles? Open Options, Audio settings.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.400
The driver: ASIO on Windows, Core Audio on a Mac, PipeWire or ALSA on Linux.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.200
The output device is where you hear LYNX. System default follows your computer.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:26.200
Buffer size: smaller answers faster when you play, larger gives the CPU more room.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:32.000
Play a test sound to check that you hear it.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.800
From anywhere, Help, Test audio output does the same.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Crackles? Raise the buffer. Notes come late? Lower it.
